# skiff - capsule carrier (drops a weapon capsule when destroyed). 28x20, 2 frames, straight top-down, faces DOWN.
# light: top-left. K exterior outline; seams where the engine pods meet the hull.
# Bulky olive transport: 18px hull, two rear-thrust engine pods (nozzles at the top = rear),
# recessed cargo bay (dark walls up-left, lit walls down-right) carrying a gold capsule (the cargo marking),
# red 2x2 sensor/cockpit in the blunt nose (bottom).
# Palette: olive a b c d e, steel 2, red n r, gold Y G L, fire O Q, K (14 colours).
# Frames: 0 nozzle fire O, 1 nozzle fire Q (flicker pair, 100 ms each, loop). Only 4 nozzle pixels change.
palette
. transparent
K #0b0d1a  outline
a #1b2622  olive-0
b #31443a  olive-1
c #4f6852  olive-2
d #7e9a78  olive-3
e #b9cfa2  olive-4
2 #2f3a5a  steel-1
