r #da3d4f  red-2
Y #a87b22  gold-1
G #e8c252  gold-2
L #fff2a8  gold-3 glint
O #ec7424  fire-2
Q #ffb347  fire-3
ramp olive a b c d e
ramp red n r
ramp fire O Q
ramp gold Y G L
